flowchart LR
    U[UAT qualified acceptance] --> V[Version and contract normalization]
    V --> J[Durable asynchronous analysis jobs]
    J --> A[Run and artifact enumeration]
    A --> D[Authorized CSV and evidence download]
    J --> C[Collection binder page context]
    C --> R[Review queue and evidence read model]
    D --> R
    R --> S[Append-only review and supersession]
    S --> I[Effective inventory projection]
    I --> B[Adjudicated fixtures and measured baseline]
    B --> Q[Pre-Alpha 2 UAT and independent dispositions]
    Q --> G{Release gate}
    G -->|Pass| X[0.2.0-pre-alpha.2 release]
    G -->|Fail| P[Remain unreleased and remediate]

    T[Template and zone evidence] -. measured by .-> B
    E[Extractor and candidate evidence] -. measured by .-> B
    O[Operations and recovery evidence] -. qualifies .-> Q
